Target: PeaceG03/PeaceSTOCKS

add a characterization test for planTenMinAlert in src/tenmin-alert.ts: pause and step failures
- planTenMinAlert({ trigger: "chain", record: undefined, historyStep: "failure", redispatchStep: "success", killSwitch: undefined }) is { action: "alert", reason: "STOP_JOB_FAILURE", key: "none:STOP_JOB_FAILURE" }
- planTenMinAlert({ trigger: "chain", record: undefined, historyStep: "success", redispatchStep: "success", killSwitch: "false" }) is { action: "none", why: "manual pause (TENMIN_AUTO_REDISPATCH not true)" }
- planTenMinAlert({ trigger: "chain", record: undefined, historyStep: "success", redispatchStep: "cancelled", killSwitch: "true" }) is { action: "alert", reason: "STOP_REDISPATCH_STEP_CANCELLED", key: "none:STOP_REDISPATCH_STEP_CANCELLED" }
- planTenMinAlert({ trigger: "chain", record: undefined, historyStep: "success", redispatchStep: "", killSwitch: "true" }) is { action: "alert", reason: "STOP_REDISPATCH_STEP_UNKNOWN", key: "none:STOP_REDISPATCH_STEP_UNKNOWN" }
- planTenMinAlert({ trigger: "fallback", record: undefined, redispatchStep: "skipped", killSwitch: "true" }) is { action: "alert", reason: "STOP_FALLBACK_STEP_SKIPPED", key: "fallback:none:skipped" }
- planTenMinAlert({ trigger: "fallback", record: undefined, redispatchStep: "success", nextAction: "wait", reason: "WAIT_GUARD_WINDOW", killSwitch: "true" }) is { action: "none", why: "planned wait (WAIT_GUARD_WINDOW)" }

(Builder pre-file, TEST_CASE_EXISTING, public-test-case-existing-v5): Peace's task (source: peace). planTenMinAlert is tested for planned waits, stops and the fallback step failure; a paused chain whose history step failed (STOP_JOB_FAILURE), a cancelled or empty redispatch step, a skipped fallback step key and a fallback planned wait are untested; this pins them. Production safety: test-only: one new src/*.test.ts file only: no source edits, no fix commit. Job B grades it fix-free: the test passes on the current code and fails with the function body stubbed. The running scanner chain is unchanged. A box dry-run on PeaceSTOCKS 0ab37c8 (Workspace main 1fbe917, live 28-rule approved list, Node 22) built exactly one candidate (public-test-case-existing-v5); a local Job B run graded it COUNTS (the new test passes on the current code and fails with planTenMinAlert stubbed); suite 614/614 with all sixteen new tests of this batch, all 4 typechecks ok. Disjoint file: each task in this batch creates its own new test file. Expected COUNTS.)
